b>n.m.</b>:<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003007\" data-end-ref=\"27003007\">Dn 3:7</data> time (prob. loan-word from OPers. <i>zrvan, zarvâna, time, age,</i> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.450\">Nö<sup>M</sup></abbr> 152 <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.569\">Scheft<sup>45</sup></abbr>; cf. BH (late); and (on change of <span class=\"greek\">ν</span> [<i>b</i>] to <i>m</i>) <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.199\">Frä<sup>ZA</sup></abbr> iii. 52; <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.436\">Nab.</abbr> <span class=\"hebrew\">זמן</span>, Palm. (<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.436\">Nab.</abbr>) <span class=\"hebrew\">זבן</span> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.401\">Lzb<sup>266</sup></abbr>; <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.401\">Lzb<sup>268</sup></abbr> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.558\">SAC<sup>48</sup></abbr>. 49);—abs. ´<span class=\"hebrew\">ז</span>: <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27002016\" data-end-ref=\"27002016\">Dn 2:16</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007012\" data-end-ref=\"27007012\">7:12</data>; emph. <span class=\"hebrew\">זִמְנָא</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"15005003\" data-end-ref=\"15005003\">Ezr 5:3</data> +; <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.505\">pl.</abbr> abs. <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27006011\" data-end-ref=\"27006011\">Dn 6:11</data> +, emph. <span class=\"hebrew\">זִמְנַיָּא</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27002021\" data-end-ref=\"27002021\">Dn 2:21</data>;—<i>time: specified time</i> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27002016\" data-end-ref=\"27002016\">Dn 2:16</data>; <i>appointed time</i> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007012\" data-end-ref=\"27007012\">7:12</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007022\" data-end-ref=\"27007022\">7:22</data>, cf. <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27002021\" data-end-ref=\"27002021\">2:21</data>; <span class=\"hebrew\">בֵּהּ זִמְנָא</span> <i>at that time</i> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"15005003\" data-end-ref=\"15005003\">Ezr 5:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003007\" data-end-ref=\"27003007\">Dn 3:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003008\" data-end-ref=\"27003008\">3:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27004033\" data-end-ref=\"27004033\">4:33</data>; (festival) <i>seasons</i> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007025\" data-end-ref=\"27007025\">7:25</data>; <i>time, occurrence</i>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27006011\" data-end-ref=\"27006011\">6:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27006014\" data-end-ref=\"27006014\">6:14</data> <i>three times in the day.</i></p> <blockquote><p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">2164</span>]</abbr> † [<span class=\"hebrew\">זְמַן</span>] <b><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.663\">vb.</abbr> denom. Hithpa.</b> agree together (Targum);—<i><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.500\">Pf.</abbr></i> 3 mpl. <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27002009\" data-end-ref=\"27002009\">Dn 2:9</data> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.523\">Qr</abbr> <span class=\"hebrew\">הִזְדַּמִּנְתּוּן</span> (<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.123\">D<sup>211</sup></abbr>, 2nd ed. 263 <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.404\">M<sup>§</sup></abbr> 12 a; <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.359\">Kt</abbr> <b>Haph.</b> <span class=\"hebrew\">הַזְמִנְתּוּן</span>, v. Targum<sup>Onk</sup> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02005014\" data-end-ref=\"02005014\">Ex 5:14</data> D:(2) 263, 403), <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.602\">sq.</abbr> Inf. <span class=\"hebrew\">לְמֵאמַר</span>.</p></blockquote>",
